## Original Content
Танкер Louloulight II задержан на 72 часа в морском порту Усть-Луга (Ленинградская область), следует из распоряжения капитана порта.

## Summary
The tanker Louloulight II was detained for 72 hours at the Ust-Luga port in Leningrad Oblast after damaging a pier, based on an order from the port captain. This maritime incident involves port operations and safety measures.

## Key Points
- Tanker Louloulight II caused damage to a pier at Ust-Luga port.
- Detention period is 72 hours as ordered by the port captain.
- The incident occurred in Leningrad Oblast, Russia.
- The action is related to port management and incident response.


